@Board list
The board list menu displays the list of boards.

The board numbers are displayed on the left, and then the board names.
On the right it shows which directions the exits from that board are.

"Find" can be used to quickly find a board by entering a prefix of the
board title.

"Add new board". Note that there is a limit of 65535 boards; you cannot
add any boards if there are already 65535 boards.
:copy
"Copy board" allows making a copy of a board. You must specify the name
of the new board, and the board number to be copied from.

See also:
!-editbrd;Board editor
